  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza Community Mental Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Gaza Community Mental Health Program to provide services to the Palestinains living in Gaza who suffer from severe mental health trauma combined with the challinging political, economic and social harrdship. Palestinians in Gaza during and after the war experienced severe social and mental stress. Women in particular experienced extreme inequalities with limited abilities to access humanitarian aid while caring for their children, their households, and themselves. This project supports community-based mental health services through psychosocial treatment, counseling, and awareness with special focus to women.</narrative>
  </description>
